  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You send ribbons of negative energy at a creature you can see within range. If the target isn’t Undead, it makes a Constitution saving throw, taking 3d10 + 25 Necrotic damage on a failure or half as much on a success. A Humanoid killed by this spell rises at the start of your next turn as a @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.actors24.Actor.mmZombie00000000]{Zombie} that follows your verbal orders for 24 hours, after which it acts according to its nature.</p><p>If the target is Undead, it gains 3d10 Temporary Hit Points instead.</p><p><strong>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</strong> The damage increases by 1d10 for each spell slot level above 5.</p>",
